---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold mb-4">MyBlog</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          记录生活，分享思考。<br />一个关于技术、生活与成长的个人博客。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-4">导航</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-400 transition-colors">首页</a></li>
          <li><a href="/categories" class="hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-400 transition-colors">分类</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-400 transition-colors">关于</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-4">社交</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          <li><a href="https://github.com/vectrol" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-400 transition-colors">GitHub</a></li>
          <li><a href="mailto:your@email.com" class="hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-400 transition-colors">Email</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 text-center text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">
      <p>&copy; {currentYear} MyBlog. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
